From cd41ca2043927e773b20a4afef6a5a9bea294cda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrosha <114847463+JRoshangah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:16:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add local UI and gameplay mods for the desktop client

- Friendly mulligan rule: unlimited mulligans back to a full hand with
  nothing put on the bottom; AI players stop after three.
- PlayFeed: non-blocking summary toasts for opponent spells, abilities,
  triggers and nonbasic lands, with condensed rules text and keyword
  glosses. Selected via the stack effect notification setting.
- BoardOverlay: turn banner, floating life changes, opponent hand as card
  backs, and the stack drawn as a card cascade on the board.
- Fanned hand with hover lift, pulsing glow on playable cards, large
  pill-shaped prompt buttons, tinted play-mats, card shadows and dimmed
  tapped permanents.
- Settings page: sticky search box and section jump bar, new
  "Arena-Style Board" section with a toggle per feature, Troubleshooting
  moved to the bottom.
